{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.poster.avif?t=1764047696\" width=640 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.webm?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/03139641f11b6c6230fc021a4382b3b8.mp4?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluff\u2019n\u2019Roll</strong> is a <strong>high-speed precision platformer</strong> where you control a determined fluffball racing through 80 hand-crafted levels across 5 vibrant worlds. Tilt the entire stage, ride real physics, and master a movement system unlike anything else, built on <strong>REAL level rotation</strong>, unlocking skips, angle tech, momentum tricks, and skill expression you won\u2019t find in any other platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/b882b2ac9fd9fdd4729421011b219906.poster.avif?t=1764047696\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/b882b2ac9fd9fdd4729421011b219906.webm?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/b882b2ac9fd9fdd4729421011b219906.mp4?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge hazards, bounce off slopes, thread tight paths, and push your rolling abilities to the limit. Collect coins, unlock tons of <strong>customization items</strong>, and conquer brutal challenge levels designed for players who crave mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 levels of fast, technical platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 worlds with unique mechanics and hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-of-a-kind <strong>real rotation</strong> <strong>system</strong> enabling deep movement tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable customization items and fluffball styles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics, instant restarts, pure skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.poster.avif?t=1764047696\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.webm?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/extras/ebc947dc907dcb98cd456961a3c45feb.mp4?t=1764047696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321020?t=1764047696","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3321020?t=1764047696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/397c242d71944ca735758b97b992b01599a8b829/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764047696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321020/397c242d71944ca735758b97b992b01599a8b829/capsule